{"ref":"BDB, פּוּט","hw":"פּוּט","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פּוּט</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.gent.</strong> prob. <strong>Libyans</strong>, or Lib. tribe; usually named with African peoples: <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:9\" href=\"/Nahum.3.9\">Na 3:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.9\">Je 46:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.10\">Ez 27:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.5\">30:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.5\">38:5</a> (𝔊 usually Λίβυες); <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:6\" href=\"/Genesis.10.6\">Gn 10:6</a> (P) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.8\">1 Ch 1:8</a> (Φουδ); + <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.19\">Is 66:19</a> (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">פּוּל</span>; 𝔊 Φουδ),—vid. Di <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:6\" href=\"/Genesis.10.6\">Gn 10:6</a> Jen<sup>ZA x. 325 ff.</sup>.","next":"BDB, פּוּטִיאֵל","prev":"BDB, פִּיחַ"}